87
00:04:14,000 --> 00:04:16,000
But this will lead to certain problems.

88
00:04:16,000 --> 00:04:18,000
When we make a mirror,

89
00:04:18,000 --> 00:04:20,000
the problem may occur.

90
00:04:20,000 --> 00:04:22,000
Because the number of its grid is large,

91
00:04:22,000 --> 00:04:24,000
it is just a little more.

92
00:04:24,000 --> 00:04:26,000
But when you export the LAMBEC file,

93
00:04:26,000 --> 00:04:28,000
these name line grids will be animated

94
00:04:28,000 --> 00:04:30,000
